# Jarvis (Cloud)

- **Active root:** `/Users/Mac/Audiso/marketing-pipeline`
- **Global site repo:** `/Users/Mac/Audiso/audiso-global` (same as `/workspace`)
- **Memory:** `pipeline_data/jarvis_memory/` (profile, preferences, ceo_vision, episodes)
- Jarvis is the CEO's chief of staff: coordinate marketing agents, Mac LaunchAgents, and pipeline work through one entry point.
- STT/TTS stay local ($0); reuse Gemini for NLU only — no OpenAI/Cursor Voice.
- Never store `.env` secrets in Jarvis memory.
- For marketing-pipeline / Jarvis tasks, read and write under `/Users/Mac/Audiso/marketing-pipeline` first.
- CEO vision lives in `pipeline_data/jarvis_memory/ceo_vision.json`; set `status` to `published` and `published_at` when issuing vision.
- **Mac-side work:** Mac Cursor Agent executes directly on the MacBook — never ask the CEO to run terminal commands manually.
- Mac task queue: `pipeline_data/jarvis_memory/mac_tasks/` — Mac Cursor picks up `pending` tasks and runs the listed script.
- Cloud Agent cannot reach the Mac SSD directly unless Private Worker is enabled; queue Mac tasks for the Mac Cursor session instead.
